# OMEMO Content Factory — example environment file.
#
# Copy this file to ".env" for local development:
#     cp .env.example .env        (bash)
#     Copy-Item .env.example .env (PowerShell)
#
# NEVER commit your real ".env" — it is git-ignored on purpose (PROJECT.md §6).
#
# Infrastructure configuration only. Secrets stay outside the repository; the values below are
# safe examples/placeholders for the settings implemented through ROADMAP Stage 7.
#
# Variables are read directly from the process environment. A ".env" auto-loader is not part of
# the runtime; export values in the shell or provide them through the deployment environment.

# Application environment: development | testing | production
OMEMO_APP_ENV=development

# Logging verbosity: CRITICAL | ERROR | WARNING | INFO | DEBUG | NOTSET
OMEMO_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Run store (ROADMAP Stage 7, ADR-0026): the SQLite file every Run is saved to.
# Unset or blank -> .omemo/runs.sqlite3 under the working directory (git-ignored).
# OMEMO_RUN_STORE_PATH=.omemo/runs.sqlite3

# Per-role LLM binding and exact token pricing (ADR-0016/0029). Replace the price placeholders with
# the provider's current Decimal rates per one million tokens; real-provider bindings fail closed
# when any pricing value is absent or invalid. Fake bindings need only OMEMO_PROVIDER__<ROLE>=fake.
# OMEMO_PROVIDER__CONTENT_RESEARCHER_V1=anthropic
# OMEMO_MODEL__CONTENT_RESEARCHER_V1=claude-model-id
# OMEMO_INPUT_PRICE_PER_MILLION__CONTENT_RESEARCHER_V1=replace_with_decimal
# OMEMO_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_MILLION__CONTENT_RESEARCHER_V1=replace_with_decimal
# OMEMO_PRICE_CURRENCY__CONTENT_RESEARCHER_V1=USD

# Notion brief board (ROADMAP Stage 9, ADR-0040/0047). All seven are required once the board is used;
# a missing or blank one fails closed. There are no default property names — they are your
# database's own. The token is the integration secret: keep it in ".env", never in the repository.
# OMEMO_NOTION_TOKEN=replace_with_integration_secret
# OMEMO_NOTION_DATABASE_ID=replace_with_database_id
# OMEMO_NOTION_READY_PROPERTY=Stage
# OMEMO_NOTION_READY_VALUE=Ready for production
# OMEMO_NOTION_RUN_STATUS_PROPERTY=Run status
# OMEMO_NOTION_RUN_ID_PROPERTY=Run id
# A property of Notion type "URL" that receives the review Doc's link.
# OMEMO_NOTION_REVIEW_LINK_PROPERTY=Review

# Google Docs review desk (ROADMAP Stage 10, ADR-0043). Both are required once the desk is used;
# a missing or blank one fails closed. The key file is a service account's JSON key — keep it
# outside the repository. Share the folder (preferably on a shared drive) with the service
# account's e-mail as an editor.
# OMEMO_GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_FILE=/path/outside/the/repo/service-account.json
# OMEMO_GOOGLE_REVIEW_FOLDER_ID=replace_with_drive_folder_id

# Production service for n8n (ROADMAP Stage 11, ADR-0049). The token is required (32+ characters)
# and must match the n8n "Concept factory service" Header Auth credential (Bearer <token>).
# OMEMO_SERVICE_TOKEN=replace_with_a_long_random_secret
# OMEMO_SERVICE_HOST=127.0.0.1
# OMEMO_SERVICE_PORT=8765
